keyboard/german-keys.h is a modified keyboard layout based on the layout
structure of wvkbd, Copyright (C) 2020 John Sullivan and contributors.
Local modifications add a German QWERTZ arrangement and German key labels,
and use the system XKB German keymap. These modifications are GPL-3.0.

build-keyboard downloads wvkbd v0.20 from its upstream source repository:
https://git.sr.ht/~proycon/wvkbd
